Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CPU Manager Project
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-psutil, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: CPU and process monitor for Raspberry Pi and Linux with GTK tray icon
